"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-735fa26e4d9021f67ed9"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-735fa26e4d9021f67ed9","source_order":[52,340,0],"order":9364},{"id":"zhanggu-e-o085","title":"旌怒骘答贫贱遇之固其宜","accounts":[{"id":"zhanggu-a-658c2284296d02296a04","label":"正文","text":"旌怒骘答贫贱遇之固其宜","evidence":["zhanggu-q-ad5c3fbde71f44f045e1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"panlu-p0007","role":"怒曰何能忍此","evidence":["zhanggu-q-ad5c3fbde71f44f045e1"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0007","role":"曰吾等贫贱是以主人以贫贱遇之固其宜也当何所耻","evidence":["zhanggu-q-ad5c3fbde71f44f045e1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-ad5c3fbde71f44f045e1"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-ad5c3fbde71f44f045e1","source_order":[52,341,0],"order":9365},{"id":"panlu-e-p046","title":"卫旌以间言启权权不信免旌官","accounts":[{"id":"panlu-a-9bf6dd67f227504a7ec0","label":"裴注·《江表传》","text":"卫旌启濬通蒋琬权不信免旌官","evidence":["panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"panlu-p0007","role":"武陵太守、以启权、被召还免官","evidence":["panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"曰承明不为此也、即封旌表以示于濬、召旌还免官","evidence":["panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0065","role":"被间者；遣密使与琬相闻系间者所云，权曰承明不为此也","evidence":["panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0047","role":"濬姨兄、零陵人、时为蜀大将军；相闻系间者所云","evidence":["panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc"]},"ordering_evidence":"panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc","source_order":[61,26,8],"order":10722}],"persons":[{"id":"panlu-p0007","name":"卫旌","evidence":["panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc","zhanggu-q-104446d3c7d9ee5f772d","zhanggu-q-0043d928ea8e4b906288","zhanggu-q-735fa26e4d9021f67ed9","zhanggu-q-ad5c3fbde71f44f045e1","zhanggu-q-29637ce93985f78f0725"],"facts":[{"id":"zhanggu-f-9a6aa8da73cc58ceb204","text":"字子旗，官至尚书。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-29637ce93985f78f0725"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhanggu-m-7ede2ac4a351ce83cbd4","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及卫旌","evidence":["zhanggu-q-7b6b8290d820884416dd"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"panlu-q-57e1bf25ae39dbeffcfc","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-dfeafa85b0764ab44d2d","layer":"pei","quote":"时濬姨兄零陵蒋琬，为蜀大将军。或有间濬于武陵太守卫旌者，云濬遣密使与琬相闻，欲有自托之计。旌以启权，权曰：‘承明不为此也！’即封旌表以示于濬；而召旌还，免官","attribution":"裴注·《江表传》","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b199fd00f2a7f26892cf","start":8,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-0043d928ea8e4b906288","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-00588e77221aff009756","layer":"original","quote":"会稽焦征羌〖2〗，郡之豪族，﹝三﹞人客放纵。骘与旌求食其地，惧为所侵；乃共修刺奉瓜〖3〗，以献征羌","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-104446d3c7d9ee5f772d","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-00588e77221aff009756","layer":"original","quote":"单身穷困，与广陵卫旌同年相善。俱以种瓜自给，昼勤四体，夜诵经传","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-29637ce93985f78f0725","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-56f7bd9c22efd9218cce","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《吴录》曰：“卫旌字子旗。官至尚书。”","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-602c3de55d816ac8e6f4","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-735fa26e4d9021f67ed9","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-3ed014dddc21c2a5ff6b","layer":"original","quote":"征羌方在内卧，驻之移时。旌欲委去，骘止之曰：“本所以来，畏其强也；而今舍去，欲以为高，只结怨耳！”良久，征羌开牖见之〖4〗。身隐几，坐帐中〖5〗；设席致地，坐骘、旌于牖外。旌愈耻之，骘辞色自若。征羌作食，身享大案，肴膳重沓〖6〗；以小盘饭与骘、旌，惟菜茹而已〖7〗。旌不能食，骘极饭致饱，乃辞出","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":339,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-7b6b8290d820884416dd","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-7abbb76c1fc797b2239e","layer":"original","quote":"骘于是条于时事业在荆州界者〖11〗，诸葛瑾、陆逊、朱然（程普）〔程秉〕、潘濬、裴玄、夏侯承、卫旌、李肃、﹝一﹞周条、石幹十一人〖12〗，甄别行状〖13〗。因上疏奖劝曰：“臣闻人君不亲小事，百官有司各任其职。故舜命九贤〖14〗，则无所用心〖15〗；弹五弦之琴，咏南风之诗〖16〗：不下堂庙，而天下治也。齐桓用管仲，被发载车〖17〗；齐国既治，又致匡合〖18〗。近汉高祖揽三杰以兴帝业〖19〗，西楚失雄俊以丧成功〖20〗。汲黯在朝〖21〗，淮南寝谋〖22〗；郅都守边〖23〗，匈奴窜迹。故贤人所在，折冲万里〖24〗；信国家之利器，崇替之所由也〖25〗。方今王化未被于汉北〖26〗，河、洛之滨尚有僭逆之丑〖27〗：诚揽英雄拔俊任贤之时也。愿明太子重以经意，则天下幸甚！”","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":332,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-ad5c3fbde71f44f045e1","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-91bf4a22e8dbb6890a8b","layer":"original","quote":"旌怒骘曰：“何能忍此？”骘曰：“吾等贫贱，是以主人以贫贱遇之〖8〗；固其宜也，当何所耻","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
